// VSCO 2 CE marimba: marimba. Samples: Versilian Studios Chamber Orchestra 2 Community Edition (VSCO-2-CE), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sgossner/VSCO-2-CE, commit 440300901dfe).
// Generated by scripts/make_vsco2_library.py; sample paths are relative to the repository root.
<control>
// volume: the median sample (loudest 400 ms) is -20 LUFS; dynamic layers keep their recorded levels.
<group> volume=17 ampeg_release=0.4 loop_mode=one_shot
